msgstr "Enregistrer la configuration"

#: includes/class-settings.php:316
msgid "Languages"
msgstr "Langues"

#: includes/class-settings.php:316
msgid ""
"Configuration123 follows the current WordPress interface language. English "
"is the source language, French is maintained by hand, and other languages "
"can use a cached Google-generated pack."
msgstr ""
"Configuration123 suit la langue actuelle de l’interface WordPress. L’anglais "
"est la langue source, le français est maintenu manuellement et les autres "
"langues peuvent utiliser un pack mis en cache généré par Google."

#: includes/class-settings.php:318
msgid "Current interface locale"
msgstr "Paramètre régional actuel de l’interface"

#: includes/class-settings.php:319
msgid "Translation source"
msgstr "Source de la traduction"

#: includes/class-settings.php:322
msgid "Bundled human translation"
msgstr "Traduction humaine intégrée"

#: includes/class-settings.php:324
msgid "Cached Google translation"
msgstr "Traduction Google mise en cache"

#: includes/class-settings.php:326
msgid "English fallback"
msgstr "Repli en anglais"

#: includes/class-settings.php:333
msgid ""
"A reviewed translation is already included for this locale; no external "
"service is needed."
msgstr ""
"Une traduction révisée est déjà incluse pour ce paramètre régional ; aucun "
"service externe n’est nécessaire."

#: includes/class-settings.php:335
msgid ""
"To generate other languages, enable Cloud Translation Basic and add this "
"server-side constant to wp-config.php:"
msgstr ""
"Pour générer d’autres langues, activez Cloud Translation Basic et ajoutez "
"cette constante côté serveur dans wp-config.php :"

#: includes/class-settings.php:337
msgid ""
"The key is never sent to the browser. Restrict it in Google Cloud and set a "
"quota or budget before use."
msgstr ""
"La clé n’est jamais envoyée au navigateur. Restreignez-la dans Google Cloud "
"et définissez un quota ou un budget avant utilisation."

